      "--- PIPELINE VERIFICATION ---\n",
      "Total valid sample size (N): 1111\n",
      "Total covariates in X_matrix: 21\n",
      "Mean 2020 Turnout rate: 83.80%\n",
      "Mean unconditional Biden support: 51.40%\n",
      "Mean unconditional Trump support: 30.51%\n"
     ]
